settings-sources-providers-section-desc = Enable or disable download providers and set the credentials, paths, and limits each one needs.
settings-sources-wallhaven-card = Wallhaven
settings-sources-wallhaven-card-desc = Search Wallhaven and download images or collections into the local library.
settings-sources-workshop-card = Steam Workshop
settings-sources-workshop-card-desc = Browse, download, and locate Wallpaper Engine Workshop items.
settings-sources-unsplash-card = Unsplash
settings-sources-unsplash-card-desc = Free high-resolution photos. Requires a free access key from unsplash.com/developers.
settings-sources-unsplash-enable-label = Enable Unsplash
settings-sources-unsplash-enable-desc = Show Unsplash in the download source picker.
settings-sources-unsplash-key-label = Access key
settings-sources-unsplash-key-desc = Your Unsplash application Access Key. Photographer credit and the required download ping are handled automatically.
settings-sources-unsplash-key-placeholder = Unsplash Access Key
settings-sources-pexels-card = Pexels
settings-sources-pexels-card-desc = Free high-resolution photos and search. Requires a free API key from pexels.com/api.
settings-sources-pexels-enable-label = Enable Pexels
settings-sources-pexels-enable-desc = Show Pexels in the download source picker.
settings-sources-pexels-key-label = API key
settings-sources-pexels-key-desc = Your Pexels API key. Photographer credit is shown automatically as Pexels requires.
settings-sources-pexels-key-placeholder = Pexels API Key
settings-sources-youtube-card = YouTube
settings-sources-youtube-card-desc = Search YouTube and download videos into the video wallpaper folder. Needs yt-dlp on PATH, no API key. Only download videos you may use.
settings-sources-youtube-enable-label = Enable YouTube
settings-sources-youtube-enable-desc = Show YouTube in the download source picker.
settings-sources-youtube-height-label = Max height
settings-sources-youtube-height-desc = Cap the downloaded resolution. Lower means smaller files and lighter playback.
settings-sources-youtube-clip-label = Clip length
settings-sources-youtube-clip-desc = YouTube loops are often hours long. Download only this many minutes; each video can override this before download. 0 downloads everything.
settings-sources-bing-card = Bing daily
settings-sources-bing-card-desc = The last 8 Bing homepage images. No key needed.
settings-sources-bing-enable-label = Enable Bing
settings-sources-bing-enable-desc = Show Bing Daily in the download source picker.
settings-sources-bing-market-label = Market
settings-sources-bing-market-desc = Bing market/region code, e.g. en-US, en-GB, ja-JP.

settings-source-defaults-card = Default filters
settings-source-defaults-desc = Start each new browser session with these filters. Changes made while browsing last until the browser closes.
settings-source-default-sort = Default sort order
settings-source-default-range = Default time range
settings-source-default-min = Minimum resolution
settings-source-default-max = Maximum resolution
settings-source-default-ratio = Default aspect ratio
settings-source-default-type = Default wallpaper type
settings-source-default-resolution = Default resolution
settings-source-default-category = Default category
settings-source-default-category-desc = Include this category when opening Wallhaven. If none are selected, General is used.
settings-source-default-purity-desc = Include this content when opening the source. Wallhaven uses SFW if no content levels are selected.

settings-sources-apply-label = Show Apply button
settings-sources-apply-desc = Show an Apply button for this source. Change several filters, then press Apply or Enter to send one search request. When off, each filter change searches immediately.
